---
import StaticPage from '../layouts/StaticPage.astro';
---

<StaticPage
	title="Contact Us"
	description="Contact the Vehicle GearUp team with car-care questions, corrections, feedback, or collaboration ideas."
	icon="mail"
	accent="teal"
	eyebrow="Let's talk cars"
	lead="Got a question, a correction, or an idea? Send it over. A real person reads every message."
>
	<div class="mail-card">
		<div>
			<p class="k">Email us</p>
			<a class="addr" href="mailto:support@vehiclegearup.com">support@vehiclegearup.com</a>
		</div>
		<a class="go" href="mailto:support@vehiclegearup.com?subject=Question%20from%20Vehicle%20GearUp">Write a message →</a>
	</div>

	<h2>What can we help with?</h2>
	<div class="cards">
		<div class="card"><div class="ico">🔧</div><h3>Car-care questions</h3><p>Stuck on a repair or a quote that doesn't feel right? Tell us what's going on.</p></div>
		<div class="card"><div class="ico">✏️</div><h3>Corrections</h3><p>Spotted something outdated or wrong in a guide? We want to fix it fast.</p></div>
		<div class="card"><div class="ico">🤝</div><h3>Collaborations</h3><p>Speaking, partnerships, or product ideas? Send the details and we'll take a look.</p></div>
	</div>

	<h2>Help us help you</h2>
	<p>If you're writing about a vehicle problem, include as much of this as you can:</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Year, make, model, and engine</strong> of the vehicle</li>
		<li><strong>What's happening</strong>: the symptom, when it started, and any warning lights</li>
		<li><strong>What you've already tried</strong> or been quoted</li>
	</ul>

	<div class="note-box">
		<span class="note-icon">ℹ️</span>
		<span>
			We can't diagnose a car over email or give an exact repair price, and we don't sell parts or take orders. For anything about an order, shipping, or returns, please contact the retailer directly. See also our <a href="/disclosure/">Disclosure</a>.
		</span>
	</div>
</StaticPage>

<style>
	.mail-card { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1rem; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; padding: 1.5rem 1.7rem; border-radius: 18px; background: rgb(var(--card)); border: 1px solid rgba(var(--gray), 0.22); border-left: 6px solid var(--pg); }
	.k { margin: 0; font-size: 0.8rem; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: rgb(var(--gray)); font-weight: 700; }
	.addr { font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 3.4vw, 1.5rem); font-weight: 700; word-break: break-all; }
	.go { background: var(--pg); color: #04201a !important; padding: 0.7rem 1.4rem; border-radius: 10px; font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: none !important; }
	.go:hover { filter: brightness(1.1); }
	.card .ico { font-size: 1.3rem; }
</style>
